#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:1 ace8c5500d7b42a8961e3f891d763715
msgid "配置系统"
msgstr "Configuration system"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:3 6a009ddac9754585b4d8b825475896b6
msgid "UniKT 的命令行参数由多个预定义配置类统一管理，同时支持每个模型通过装饰器注册自己的专属参数。本页介绍如何查看、使用和扩展这些参数。"
msgstr ""
"UniKT's CLI arguments are managed centrally by several predefined "
"configuration classes, while each model can register its own dedicated "
"parameters via a decorator. This page describes how to view, use, and "
"extend these parameters."

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:5 4a73460ac25843a3a2e1adb50fca3fa6
msgid "查看可用参数"
msgstr "View available parameters"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:7 4aaaae41f217463a8e8111d08f7f9849
msgid "训练脚本支持分层参数解析：先加载通用参数，再按 ``-m`` 指定的模型注入模型专属参数。在模型名后加 ``-h`` 即可看到完整的参数列表："
msgstr ""
"The training script supports layered argument parsing: general parameters"
" are loaded first, then model-specific parameters are injected based on "
"the model specified by ``-m``. Append ``-h`` after the model name to see "
"the full parameter list:"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:13 72a231069c124740a183dc03612b5e3e
msgid ""
"输出会按参数组分类，依次显示 General Parameters、Data Parameters、Early Stopping "
"Parameters、Compile Parameters 和 GIKT Parameters。直接运行 ``python train.py "
"-h`` 则只显示通用参数组。"
msgstr ""
"The output is grouped by category, listing General Parameters, Data "
"Parameters, Early Stopping Parameters, Compile Parameters, and GIKT "
"Parameters in turn. Running ``python train.py -h`` directly shows only "
"the general parameter groups."

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:15 f2a906a198a64136969e5621b965b5a7
msgid "通用参数组"
msgstr "General parameter groups"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:17 b8c0557880eb4f70a0f564c28bb832b4
msgid ""
"这些参数在 ``utils/config/param_config.py`` 中定义为 ``BaseParamConfig`` 的子类，由 "
"``train.py`` 无条件加载。"
msgstr ""
"These parameters are defined in ``utils/config/param_config.py`` as "
"subclasses of ``BaseParamConfig`` and are loaded unconditionally by "
"``train.py``."

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:21 b38ee3bddbf9455a9c6d6dc17fa5e004
msgid "GeneralParams — 运行控制"
msgstr "GeneralParams — Run control"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:23 e9756a482b9245d4ab6001f5a3cbaf48
msgid "控制设备、日志、种子等基础行为："
msgstr "Controls basic behaviors such as device, logging, and seed:"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:33 12b12ebb97b8498ca89e06e0bf4cdd7f
msgid ""
"``--seed`` 用于复现实验，设置为不同值可以测试模型对随机性的敏感度。``--device`` 默认自动检测 GPU 可用性，但在多 "
"GPU 机器上建议显式指定（如 ``cuda:0``）。``--no_swanlab`` 关闭 SwanLab "
"记录，适合本地快速迭代时减少网络开销。"
msgstr ""
"``--seed`` is used to reproduce experiments; setting it to different "
"values lets you test the model's sensitivity to randomness. ``--device`` "
"auto-detects GPU availability by default, but on multi-GPU machines you "
"should specify it explicitly (e.g. ``cuda:0``). ``--no_swanlab`` disables"
" SwanLab logging, which is useful for reducing network overhead during "
"fast local iteration."

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:35 403ab40173f6447aae28c9b1454a3f6c
msgid ""
"**注意：** 确定性算法默认开启，会调用 ``torch.use_deterministic_algorithms`` "
"确保可复现性。若某个算子不支持 deterministic 模式导致训练失败，可以用 ``--general.deterministic false`` 关闭。"
msgstr ""
"**Note:** ``--general.deterministic`` is enabled by default (``True``) and "
"calls ``torch.use_deterministic_algorithms`` to ensure reproducibility. "
"If a particular operator does not support deterministic mode and causes "
"training to fail, disable it with ``--general.deterministic false``."

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:39 b04d58d87bf04379bb586c448569f747
msgid "DataParams — 数据加载"
msgstr "DataParams — Data loading"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:49 e765502822584fdc9f73a4183159872e
msgid ""
"``--dataset`` / ``-d`` 是必选参数，可选值包括 "
"``algebra2005``、``algebra2006``、``assistments09``、``assistments12``、``assistments15``、``assistments17``、``bridge2006``、``ednet_kt1``、``junyi2015``、``nips2020_t34``、``slepemapy``，共"
" 11 个数据集。"
msgstr ""
"``--dataset`` / ``-d`` is a required argument. Valid values are "
"``algebra2005``, ``algebra2006``, ``assistments09``, ``assistments12``, "
"``assistments15``, ``assistments17``, ``bridge2006``, ``ednet_kt1``, "
"``junyi2015``, ``nips2020_t34``, and ``slepemapy`` — 11 datasets in "
"total."

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:51 d025e9cc8ff7464e863691b10d791263
msgid ""
"``--fold`` 指定当前使用第几折（0-indexed），与 ``--kfold`` 配合完成 K 折交叉验证。例如 ``--kfold 5"
" --fold 0`` 表示 5 折中的第 1 折。``--test_ratio`` 控制测试集用户占比。测试集用户不参与训练和验证，与 "
"``--kfold`` 同时生效——``test_ratio`` 决定测试集比例，``kfold`` 对剩余数据划分训练/验证折。"
msgstr ""
"``--fold`` specifies which fold to use (0-indexed) and works with "
"``--kfold`` to perform K-fold cross validation. For example, ``--kfold 5 "
"--fold 0`` selects the first of 5 folds. ``--test_ratio`` controls the "
"proportion of users held out for the test set. Test-set users do not "
"participate in training or validation and take effect alongside "
"``--kfold`` — ``test_ratio`` determines the test-set proportion, and "
"``kfold`` splits the remaining data into training/validation folds."

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:53 8264316ed83d42879460dce28fbf9890
msgid ""
"``--max_seq_len`` 会截断过长的交互序列，减小显存占用。数据集 ``assistments09`` 序列通常较短，设 200 "
"足够；``ednet_kt1`` 序列较长，可适当增大至 500。"
msgstr ""
"``--max_seq_len`` truncates overly long interaction sequences to reduce "
"GPU memory usage. The ``assistments09`` dataset generally has short "
"sequences, so 200 is sufficient; ``ednet_kt1`` has longer sequences and "
"can be increased to around 500."

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:57 f792c7b2e0fc460198ba37747fddab6f
msgid "EarlyStoppingParams — 早停控制"
msgstr "EarlyStoppingParams — Early stopping control"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:67 8266897404444c7997ee73f952bd8f24
msgid ""
"``--es_monitor`` 指定监控指标，在验证集上计算。分类任务通常用 ``auc``（AUC 越高越好，``--es_mode "
"max``），回归任务用 ``rmse``（越低越好，``--es_mode min``）。``--es_patience`` 设为 0 "
"可以完全禁用早停。"
msgstr ""
"``--es_monitor`` specifies the metric to monitor, computed on the "
"validation set. Classification tasks typically use ``auc`` (higher is "
"better, ``--es_mode max``), while regression tasks use ``rmse`` (lower is"
" better, ``--es_mode min``). Setting ``--es_patience`` to 0 disables "
"early stopping entirely."

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:69 ddb724baa159400b8004f77c56298666
msgid ""
"``--es_min_delta`` "
"决定\"有改进\"的阈值：只有当前指标与历史最优的差值超过此值，才视为有效改进。面对波动较大的训练曲线时，适当增大此值（如 "
"0.005）可以避免因噪声提前停止。"
msgstr ""
"``--es_min_delta`` sets the threshold for what counts as an "
"\"improvement\": only when the current metric exceeds the historical best"
" by more than this value is it treated as a valid improvement. For noisy "
"training curves, increasing this value (e.g. to 0.005) can prevent "
"premature stopping due to noise."

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:71 1d7277bb1a4f43a193a6591f922ef7f5
msgid "模型特定参数"
msgstr "Model-specific parameters"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:73 3519a84c02bd4bd2acad94eaeeca5634
msgid ""
"每个模型通过 ``@register_model_params`` 装饰器将自己独有的超参数暴露给 CLI。这套机制由三步组成：定义参数类 → "
"注册到全局表 → CLI 自动注入。"
msgstr ""
"Each model exposes its own unique hyperparameters to the CLI via the "
"``@register_model_params`` decorator. This mechanism has three steps: "
"define a parameter class, register it in the global table, then the CLI "
"injects it automatically."

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:75 0bb9d465054a4d46a930f624f5f7bc90
msgid "如何工作"
msgstr "How it works"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:77 8154dace760a49798bc5880693aa2dd5
msgid "以 GIKT 为例，在 ``model/GIKT/GIKT_trainer.py`` 中："
msgstr "Using GIKT as an example, in ``model/GIKT/GIKT_trainer.py``:"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:114 aebec2a32f044022b5c92285578266ee
msgid "``define_params`` 返回一个 ``(组名, 参数字典)`` 的元组。参数字典的键是 CLI 参数名，值为配置字典，支持以下字段："
msgstr ""
"``define_params`` returns a ``(group_name, params_dict)`` tuple. The keys"
" of ``params_dict`` are CLI argument names and the values are "
"configuration dicts supporting the following fields:"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:116 a2f2f37ae00145889b96361968cdf262
msgid ""
"``type``：参数类型，``int`` / ``float`` / ``str`` / ``bool``。``bool`` 类型会自动转换为 "
"``store_true`` 或 ``store_false`` action"
msgstr ""
"``type``: the argument type, ``int`` / ``float`` / ``str`` / ``bool``. A "
"``bool`` type is automatically converted to a ``store_true`` or "
"``store_false`` action"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:117 8e78c3521f6742bbbf7a7c584da355e7
msgid "``default``：默认值"
msgstr "``default``: the default value"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:118 e640d9c19d0342858742a793e0b3b823
msgid "``short``：短选项名（如 ``\"ed\"`` → ``-ed``）"
msgstr "``short``: the short option name (e.g. ``\"ed\"`` → ``-ed``)"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:119 6d4e6d3b0ac14981abbf16f6454ecc41
msgid "``help``：帮助文本"
msgstr "``help``: the help text"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:120 6c472154e6be44abb613282b455ac724
msgid "``choices``：可选值列表（用于 ``str`` 类型）"
msgstr "``choices``: the list of allowed values (for the ``str`` type)"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:122 c8c6924187e242458b058090dd85b5e7
msgid ""
"注册到全局表 ``PARAM_CONFIGS`` 后，``train.py`` 在解析参数时会调用 "
"``get_model_params(\"GIKT\").add_args(parser)``，将这些参数注入到 ArgumentParser "
"中。"
msgstr ""
"Once registered in the global ``PARAM_CONFIGS`` table, ``train.py`` calls"
" ``get_model_params(\"GIKT\").add_args(parser)`` during argument parsing "
"to inject these parameters into the ArgumentParser."

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:124 5d221101c94442648c97403a878f0d9d
msgid "使用模型参数"
msgstr "Using model parameters"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:126 cf629df44f224515ae8178ff9e7e4f92
msgid "注册后即可像通用参数一样在命令行中使用："
msgstr ""
"Once registered, they can be used on the command line just like the "
"general parameters:"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:136 217433674da9414297db981d9cd4536c
msgid ""
"GIKT 特有的参数如 "
"``--skill_neighbor_num``（每跳技能邻居采样数）、``--hist_neighbor_num``（同技能历史邻居数 "
"M）只在使用 GIKT 模型时出现，切换到其他模型会显示不同的专属参数集。"
msgstr ""
"GIKT-specific arguments such as ``--skill_neighbor_num`` (number of skill"
" neighbors sampled per hop) and ``--hist_neighbor_num`` (number M of "
"same-skill historical neighbors) appear only when using the GIKT model; "
"switching to another model displays a different set of dedicated "
"parameters."

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:138 89bdc10739d549b48fa6764a91f8033d
msgid "为新模型添加参数"
msgstr "Adding parameters for a new model"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:140 8ca8fbd72e9a4f83924e679f03032a00
msgid "如果你在添加一个新模型，按三步完成参数集成："
msgstr ""
"If you are adding a new model, complete parameter integration in three "
"steps:"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:142 7f7c99b06a8f4b13aa61707a755ddff4
msgid "**1. 定义参数类**（在 ``model/YourModel/YourModel_trainer.py``）："
msgstr ""
"**1. Define the parameter class** (in "
"``model/YourModel/YourModel_trainer.py``):"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:158 0a463291f8aa4b9aafdd666779b6d613
msgid ""
"**2. 注册**：装饰器 ``@register_model_params(\"YourModel\")`` "
"已完成注册。**注意**：装饰器参数必须是字符串字面量，不能使用变量或表达式，否则 AST "
"静态发现（``utils/core/discovery.py``）无法识别。"
msgstr ""
"**2. Register**: the ``@register_model_params(\"YourModel\")`` decorator "
"handles registration. **Note**: the decorator argument must be a string "
"literal; variables or expressions are not accepted, otherwise AST-based "
"static discovery (``utils/core/discovery.py``) cannot recognize it."

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:160 e7835cf4be794245bbde34df82641339
msgid "**3. 配置使用**：完成定义后无需任何额外步骤，``train.py`` 会自动发现并加载。最终用法与其他模型一致："
msgstr ""
"**3. Use it**: once defined, no extra steps are required — ``train.py`` "
"discovers and loads it automatically. The final usage matches other "
"models:"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:166 81104292ecd64ff693fc4cfcfac54f07
msgid ""
"**注意**：若无法通过 ``-h`` 看到新参数，检查装饰器参数是否为字符串字面量，且文件位于 ``model/`` "
"目录下（静态发现只扫描该目录）。"
msgstr ""
"**Note**: if the new parameters do not appear via ``-h``, verify that the"
" decorator argument is a string literal and that the file is under the "
"``model/`` directory (static discovery only scans that directory)."

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:168 642754dd8db04ff5ba4b34d3fc0d0b71
msgid "SwanLab 环境变量"
msgstr "SwanLab environment variables"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:170 07a77cb23dda41bfaf6bc281a19447c2
msgid ""
"SwanLab 作为实验追踪后端通过环境变量配置，而非命令行参数。相关变量在 "
"``utils/training/metric_logger.py`` 的 ``SwanLabMetricLogger.init_run`` "
"中读取："
msgstr ""
"SwanLab, as the experiment tracking backend, is configured through "
"environment variables rather than CLI arguments. The relevant variables "
"are read in ``SwanLabMetricLogger.init_run`` within "
"``utils/training/metric_logger.py``:"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md e207efae1ba54f69af92f689beeb07d2
msgid "变量"
msgstr "Variable"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md 37e2fabdf5ae4e608f5647223824f6b8
msgid "说明"
msgstr "Description"

