#: ../../source/advanced/config.md d07cc4698faf4496b670232e3674b2b3
msgid "``LARK_SECRET``"
msgstr "``LARK_SECRET``"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md 6cb7b8342adb43e29dfe1150c984ac01
msgid "飞书机器人签名密钥，与 ``LARK_WEBHOOK_URL`` 配对使用"
msgstr "Lark bot signing secret, used together with ``LARK_WEBHOOK_URL``"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:180 6be52dfd12134eee997404c9610b19a1
msgid "建议在项目根目录创建 ``.env`` 文件（已加入 ``.gitignore``）："
msgstr ""
"It is recommended to create a ``.env`` file in the project root (already "
"listed in ``.gitignore``):"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:190 4d2ab7560d5248cab6c9f1fbba080d29
msgid ""
"代码中通过 ``dotenv.load_dotenv`` 自动加载。**注意**：SwanLab 需要在首次使用前完成登录认证，在终端执行 "
"``swanlab login`` 获取 API 密钥。``--no_swanlab`` 或 ``--nsl`` 标志可以完全关闭 SwanLab"
" 后端，只保留本地 CSV 记录。"
msgstr ""
"It is loaded automatically in the code via ``dotenv.load_dotenv``. "
"**Note**: SwanLab requires authentication before first use — run "
"``swanlab login`` in the terminal to obtain an API key. The "
"``--no_swanlab`` or ``--nsl`` flag disables the SwanLab backend entirely,"
" keeping only local CSV logging."

